<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: United Drug year pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>United Drug year pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		23.21		  vs 19.69</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.20		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 9.0		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    6.00		   vs 5.06</p>
<p> Turnover		   247.58		 vs 213.73</p>
<p> Operating profit	 6.71		   vs 5.61</p>
<p> Net interest payable   0.71		   vs 0.56</p>
<p> Tax charge		 1.88		   vs 1.70</p>
<p> Net taxed		  4.13		   vs 3.36</p>
<p> Attributable	     3.05		   vs 2.29</p>
<p> Pay date		   Feb 11</p>
<p> Div registration date  Dec 10</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Dec 2</p>
<p>NOTE - Pharmaceutical distribution group United Drug Plc announced a one-for-four rights issue to raise 12.4 million punts net of expenses at a price of 290 pence per share.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
